==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

